Part of framing the "Sustainable Design" chapter needs to be defining design. Then defining sustainable design.

What do books like [[The Philosophy of Design]] and [[The Design Way]] say? what other definitions have been helpful?

[[Glenn Parsons]] in The Philosophy of Design, "[Design is] the intentional solution of a problem, by the creation of plans for a new sort of thing"

And then what is [[Sustainable Design]] anyway? How does [[Circular Design]] and/or [[Regenerative Design]] fit in?

And is sort of pushing THROUGH sustainable into the regenerative the important piece we're adding/talking about when defining design moving forward?